message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use the data,
  please cite the dataset listed under references.
type: software
title: Hybrasil Star and Exoplanet Map
abstract: >-
  An interactive map of nearby star systems, their stars, planets and moons
  drawn from published orbits, with the bands round each star where common
  solvents could be liquid.
